./lib/mark

-- mark

:----
%file: lib/mark.bx
(prop + mark _ (= "a\uDC00b"))
:----
%crash

Exception: “\uDC00” at line 1, column 21 is half of a surrogate pair, which is no character by itself. Write the character itself in the text
<lib/mark.bx:1>
    (prop + mark _ (= "a\uDC00b"))
                        ^
